  "confidence": "medium",
  "notes": "Single-page PDF, size B, ENG 2/78, checked (signature). P1 (upper) single row: PGM 1, PGM 2, AUX and CUE outputs, left and right, two contacts each (polarity unmarked, keyed a / b), 9 SHIELD, 22 CHASSIS. P2 (lower): Edge connector drawn as two columns, letters A-Z (no G, I, O, Q) beside numbers 1-22; each column carries its own label, so the letter and number contacts are recorded as separate contacts. Where both sides carry the same label the two contacts form one port (keyed a = letter side, b = number side, polarity not marked on the drawing). LINE A / LINE B inputs, insert, control and power. Control directions (CTL / EXT inputs as control_in, CTL OUT / TALLY / TIMER RESET as control_out) are taken from the names. Legend: NC not connected, IC internally connected."
}
